{"path":"ranges/transform_view/transform_view","title":"std::ranges::transform_view<V,F>::transform_view","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::transform_view&lt;V,F&gt;::</span>transform_view","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/transform_view/transform_view","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">transform_view<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><span class=\"kw2965\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_initializable</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><span class=\"kw2965\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_initializable</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>F<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> transform_view<span class=\"br0\">(</span> V base, F fun <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a <code>transform_view</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Default constructor. <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/value_initialization\">Value-initializes</a> the underlying view <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/transform_view#Data_members\"><code><i>base_</i></code></a> and the transformation function <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/transform_view#Data_members\"><code><i>fun_</i></code></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Move constructs the underlying view <code><i>base_</i></code> from <code>base</code> and the transformation function <code><i>fun_</i></code> from <code>fun</code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> base\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> view\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> fun\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> transformation function\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>Demonstrates π approximation using serial expansion of arc tangent of 1:<br>\n <code>atan(1) = π/4 ≈ 1 - 1/3 + 1/5 - 1/7 + 1/9 - 1/11 + ...</code></p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;numbers&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;numeric&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setprecision\"><span class=\"kw1813\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setprecision</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">15</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/fixed\"><span class=\"kw1801\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fixed</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> atan1term <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ranges</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/transform_view\"><span class=\"kw2940\">views::<span class=\"me2\">transform</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>n <span class=\"sy2\">%</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> n <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> iterations <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">10</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">100</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1000</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"st0\">'000'</span><span class=\"nu8\">000</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> seq <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ranges</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view\"><span class=\"kw2932\">views::<span class=\"me2\">iota</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, iterations<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> atan1term<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> accum <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/accumulate\"><span class=\"kw1663\">std::<span class=\"me2\">accumulate</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>seq.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, seq.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"π ≈ \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> accum <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (iterations: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> iterations <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"π ≈ \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><span class=\"kw3345\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numbers</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">pi</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (std::numbers::pi)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>π ≈ 4.000000000000000 (iterations: 1)\nπ ≈ 2.666666666666667 (iterations: 2)\nπ ≈ 3.466666666666667 (iterations: 3)\nπ ≈ 2.895238095238096 (iterations: 4)\nπ ≈ 3.339682539682540 (iterations: 5)\nπ ≈ 3.041839618929403 (iterations: 10)\nπ ≈ 3.131592903558554 (iterations: 100)\nπ ≈ 3.140592653839794 (iterations: 1000)\nπ ≈ 3.141591653589774 (iterations: 1000000)\nπ ≈ 3.141592653589793 (std::numbers::pi)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3714\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3714</a><br>(<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2711R1\" data-external=\"1\">P2711R1</a>)\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>the multi-parameter constructor was not explicit\n</td>\n<td>made explicit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2325R3\" data-external=\"1\">P2325R3</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>if <code>F</code> is not <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><code>default_initializable</code></a>, the default constructor<br>constructs a <code>transform_view</code> which does not contain an <code>F</code>\n</td>\n<td>the <code>transform_view</code> is also<br>not <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><code>default_initializable</code></a>\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/transform_view","title":"std::ranges::views::transform, std::ranges::transform_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges: